# ============================================================
# Server-side environment variables — NEVER expose to the client
# ============================================================

# Your Google Gemini API key.
# This is a SERVER-ONLY secret. It is read by Vercel serverless
# functions in /api and is NEVER bundled into frontend JavaScript.
#
# IMPORTANT:
#   - Do NOT prefix this with VITE_ (that would expose it to the browser).
#   - Do NOT import it in any file inside /src.
#   - On Vercel: add this in Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
